  "description": "Current public exchange projections for scoped work, execution, artifacts, reports, organization outcomes and maintenance. Canonical Work uses committed_work, including explicit criteria/execution revisions and conditional committed_at. Identity private records belong to identity.schema.json and are not public record union members. Not a whole-Instance persistence schema."
}
